                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game... It is so early, that there is just a half-assed map, and terrible network performance, with just 2 players on the server. It should never have been released in this state, Early Access or not.\n\nVideo (Gameplay): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vI-nSKx8B8k\n\nPros\n- At least the servers allow you to connect\n\nCons\n- Horrible visuals/Textures/sounds\n- Controls are janky as fuck. You need to hit RMB and LMB to attack, but only while standing still...\n- Map is very empty, aside from a couple of buildings\n- Nothing to do...AT ALL.",
